<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="skill">silver-dagger</ansi> (blacksmithing recipe)

A dagger of silver, against iron: damage x0.85, speed x1.05, weight x1.1.
Silver is too soft to be a soldier's metal, but it is quick in the hand
and it wards against what is not flesh.

